{"unit_id":"ddy-007__dsh-client-resume-button#card-zh","repo":"ddy-007/dsh-client-resume-button","commit":"72aba55994b9bebf325c1ca2a3a7071dd7b9078e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"client-resume-button 是一款面向 DSH Web 与桌面客户端的会话继续插件：当上一轮因用户停止、崩溃中断或运行错误结束时，它在输入框区域显示「继续」按钮。插件通过会话投影追踪待续跑轮次，并调用宿主 agent 的远端动作发送继续提示和操作指引。按钮会在草稿或附件待提交时收起，新一轮开始后中断标记清除。适合希望从最近一次中断处重新交代任务的 DSH 用户；不会恢复未写入日志的半截输出。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:52-64"]}
{"unit_id":"ddy-007__dsh-client-resume-button#card-en","repo":"ddy-007/dsh-client-resume-button","commit":"72aba55994b9bebf325c1ca2a3a7071dd7b9078e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"client-resume-button adds a Continue button to the DSH web and desktop composer after a stop, interruption, or error. It tracks resumable turns, hides during drafting, and asks the live agent to continue. A new turn clears the marker; partial output cannot be restored.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:78-105"]}
